SUMMARY:AI Village 2027
LOCATION:HEIA-FR\, Boulevard de Pérolles 80\, Fribourg
DESCRIPTION:Day-long Swiss Cyber Storm spin-off bringing AI practitioners\,
  students and security professionals together for hands-on workshops\, tal
 ks\, demos and a CTF challenge on where AI and cybersecurity meet.\n\nOrga
 niser: AI Village\, a spin-off of the Swiss Cyber Storm Association\n\nDet
 ails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/ai-village-2027-f
 ribourg/
