SUMMARY:DigiDay Bern 2027 — Digitale Souveränität
LOCATION:Kursaal Bern\, Kornhausstrasse 3
DESCRIPTION:Day on digital sovereignty for the Swiss–Austrian e-governmen
 t community\, covering the government cloud\, e-ID\, cybersecurity\, data 
 governance and how AI is regulated and used across public administration a
 nd industry.\n\nOrganiser: ADVANTAGE AUSTRIA Zürich\, in cooperation with
  the Austrian Embassy in Bern\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissda
 taevents.ch/events/digiday-bern-2027/
